---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Services" description="AI transformation consultation and senior AI development by Ankush Goyal.">
  <section>
    <h1 class="title-display">Services.</h1>
    <p class="subtitle mt-8">
      Two ways I typically work with teams: high‑ROI AI strategy, or hands‑on senior delivery.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    <div class="card p-7">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ink-700/20 bg-white/55">
        <img
          src="/project-images/AI transformation consultation.png"
          alt="AI transformation consultation service visual"
          width="1200"
          height="720"
          loading="lazy"
          class="aspect-[16/9] h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-700">AI Transformation Consultation</h2>
        <span class="chip">2–4 weeks</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-600">
        Discovery calls with stakeholders → research → a clear report with prioritized AI opportunities, feasibility, and next
        steps.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-600/85">Deliverables include ROI ranking, data readiness, architecture sketch, and rollout plan.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card p-7">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-ink-700/20 bg-white/55">
        <img
          src="/project-images/AI development.png"
          alt="Senior AI development service visual"
          width="1200"
          height="720"
          loading="lazy"
          class="aspect-[16/9] h-full w-full object-cover"
        />
      </div>
      <div class="mt-5 flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-700">Senior AI Development</h2>
        <span class="chip">Hands‑on</span>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink-600">
        End‑to‑end implementation of production-grade AI systems, with strong communication across technical and non‑technical
        teams.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-ink-600/85">Common builds: RAG, chatbots, voice agents, and automation pipelines.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-16">
    <div class="card p-7">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink-700">Let&apos;s work</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-ink-600">
        If you share your context (goals, data sources, constraints), I’ll respond with suggested next steps.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn-main mt-6">
        Email me
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
